          title: '2026 Uthara Nakshatra Dates',
          description: "[ 2026 Uthara Nakshatra Dates ]\n\nSwamiye Saranam Ayyappa! The birth star of Lord Sri Ayyappa is Uthara (Uttara Phalguni). Specifically, Lord Ayyappa manifested on the Uthara Nakshatra day in the Meena month (Kerala calendar). Uthara Nakshatra recurs approximately once every 27 days.\n\nFor devotees who wish to perform sacred Ayyappa Pooja and Abhishekam on Uthara Nakshatra, the exact monthly dates for the year 2026 are provided below.\n\nIn some months, Uthara Nakshatra occurs twice (once at the beginning of the month and again towards the end of the month). In 2026, both April and December have two Uthara Nakshatra dates.\n\nSwamiye Saranam Ayyappa - April 1, 2026: Pamba Arattu & Sri Ayyappa Swamy Jayanthi.\n\n| No | Date | Day | Nakshatram |\n| 1 | 8-1-2026 | Thursday | Uthara |\n| 2 | 5-2-2026 | Thursday | Uthara |\n| 3 | 5-3-2026 | Thursday | Uthara |\n| 4 | 1-4-2026 | Wednesday | Uthara |\n| 5 | 28-4-2026 | Tuesday | Uthara |\n| 6 | 25-5-2026 | Monday | Uthara |\n| 7 | 22-6-2026 | Monday | Uthara |\n| 8 | 19-7-2026 | Sunday | Uthara |\n| 9 | 15-8-2026 | Saturday | Uthara |\n| 10 | 12-9-2026 | Saturday | Uthara |\n| 11 | 09-10-2026 | Friday | Uthara |\n| 12 | 05-11-2026 | Thursday | Uthara |\n| 13 | 03-12-2026 | Thursday | Uthara |\n| 14 | 30-12-2026 | Wednesday | Uthara |",
